OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FKris Jepson attended the cardiac
OL,8,Fscreening session in Middlesbrough.
OL,10,FHundreds of young people aged between
OL,11,F14 and 35 have attended a heart
OL,12,Fscreening session in Middlesbrough in
OL,13,Fmemory of a teenager who died from
OL,14,Fcardiac arrest.
OL,16,FJames Campbell was just 16 when he
OL,17,Fpassed away at his Middlesbrough home
OL,18,Fin his sleep.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
