OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FHe had an undiagnosed heart condition
OL,8,Fand had never experienced any worrying
OL,9,Fsymptoms leading up to his death in
OL,10,F2013.
OL,12,FKaren Campbell, his mother, has raised
OL,13,Fawareness of heart screening ever
OL,14,Fsince and through her fundraising
OL,15,Fefforts, she has commissioned the
OL,16,Fscreenings in her town.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FShe said: "There was nothing that you
OL,8,Fwould think of that would have been a
OL,9,Fcause for concern. It turns out he's
OL,10,Fone of 12 a week that this happens to,
OL,11,Fso apparently fit and healthy young
OL,12,Fpeople.
OL,14,F"So, the screenings today are really
OL,15,Fimportant and they are there to make
OL,16,Fsure it doesn't happen to anyone else."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FShe added: "He was a boy who always
OL,8,Fwanted to help others when he was
OL,9,Fhere. I'd like to think that we are
OL,10,Fdoing him proud and we're still doing
OL,11,Fthat on his behalf. It's just lovely
OL,12,Fto think that our boy is not
OL,13,Fforgotten, and we're still doing some
OL,14,Fgood in his memory."
OL,16,FThe screenings were carried out by
OL,17,Fcharity Cardiac Risk in the Young,
OL,18,Fwhich tours the country offering
OL,19,Fmobile screening sessions.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
