OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FCardiologist Dr Veronika Azidou, told
OL,8,FITV News that the "vast majority" of
OL,9,Fpatients will leave the screening with
OL,10,Fa clean bill of health, but referrals
OL,11,Fcan be made if anyone does present
OL,12,Fwith an abnormal reading on their ECG.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FShe explained: "We'd want to refer
OL,8,Fthem for further investigation, so
OL,9,Fsometimes we pick up very small things
OL,10,Fthat could be like electrical
OL,11,Fdisorders, some kind of ECG
OL,12,Falteration, and we say 'maybe there's
OL,13,Fsomething here, maybe we should
OL,14,Ffurther investigate that, let's refer
OL,15,Fthe people for further investigation
OL,16,Fthat should always be done at the
OL,17,Fhospital in the NHS in a cardiology
OL,18,Fclinic."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
