OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FJack Cooper, 32, attended the
OL,8,Fscreening after his partner had
OL,9,Fcompleted one previously. He described
OL,10,Fthe ECG as "painless" and said the
OL,11,Ftest helps the doctor to check heart
OL,12,Frhythm, diagnose heart attacks, and
OL,13,Ffind the cause of unexplained chest
OL,14,Fpain or dizziness.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,393,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786744252
OL,3,CHundreds attend heart screening in
OL,4,Cmemory of teen who had undiagnosed
OL,5,Ccondition
OL,7,FHe said: "I think it's really
OL,8,Fimportant for people to get checked,
OL,9,Fbecause sometimes these symptoms, they
OL,10,Fdon't show themselves, so it's
OL,11,Fimportant that people get checked out,
OL,12,Fbecause it's not something that you
OL,13,Fwould regularly have done otherwise.
OL,15,F"It's super simple. I came in ten
OL,16,Fminutes ago, went in, had the actual
OL,17,FECG, I then went in and talked the
OL,18,Fresults through with the doctor.
OL,19,FQuick, painless, super straight
OL,20,Fforward, but it could save lives, so
OL,21,Fit's really important."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
